🔴 samples from round 5's sampler (no ctrl_logs): rc 2
🔴 a sampler that never saw the controller's log: rc 2
🔴 a log the sampler never saw reach its push: rc 2
🔴 a controller log with no push and no entry: rc 2
🔴 uncommitted: a code file and an audit .json are recorded, a doc .md and an audit .tsv are not
